          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On Tuesday, May 16, 2023, the witness was walking at the Notre-Dame de la Paix Belvedere (Cd 36 Nd de la Paix / La Plaine des Cafres) on the island of Réunion. He subsequently noticed the presence of an Unidentified Aerial Phenomenon (PAN) in one of the photos taken with his smartphone during this walk. The investigation demonstrates that the witness likely photographed an animal, such as an insect, bird, or butterfly. It is highly probable that this was a butterfly endemic to Réunion named \"Neptis Dumetorum,\" which was moving quickly near the camera lens. Approximately 2 cm long, this butterfly exhibits notable similarities in shape and color to the mentioned Unidentified Aerial Phenomenon (PAN) (see the investigation report). This case is classified \"A,\" very likely a butterfly.",
